  "description": "Is the pipeline producing sane output? These panels read the curated gold layer through Trino and exist to catch bad loads -- row counts that stop reconciling, an authorization rate that leaves its plausible band, an hour with no volume, a sudden shift in method or country mix. Business analytics is served by the gold API, not from here."
